{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 11, :comments ["<b>Ephraim</b> — the meaning is like a bird: concerning the swiftness, that they will not rejoice and will have no glory from birth; also from the womb — when one sees the pregnant womb that swells from pregnancy, like when the menstrual blood of a woman ceases. Now the meaning is that the pregnancy will diminish, and even if there is one, it will not reach being seen; and if it reaches, the child will die before birth; and this [word] is like דיעה (knowledge). Therefore after it: if they bear and raise their children, I will bereave them, that they will not reach being human."], :book :hosea, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 9, :notes {0 "The comment is textually dense and possibly corrupt in places; translated hyper-literally without smoothing. The referent of 'this [word] is like דיעה' is unclear from context and left cryptic."}, :source-witnesses [["Ibn Ezra on Hosea -- Daat" "http://www.daat.ac.il/daat/olam_hatanah/mefaresh.asp?book=15&perek=1&mefaresh=ezra"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T18:50:44.098447658Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}